            "has_padding": true,
            "heading_size": "regular",
            "text": "<h2>Youth & Earth is a registered pharmacy</h2><p>xxxxx</p><p>Located in: </p><p>Nexus BioLink<br/>Unit 4<br/>Cleton Business Park<br/>Tipton<br/>United Kingdom, DY4 7TR</p><p>Telephone Number:020 3997 7800</p><p>Email:  <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@youthandearth.com\" title=\"mailto:enquiries@youthandearth.com\">enquiries@youthandearth.com</a></p><h2>Opening hours</h2><p>Our website is always open, and you can place an order 24 hours per day. However our pharmacy is only open when we have pharmacy staff on site - during our opening hours - and any pharmacy related orders will only be processed during those hours.</p><p><strong>Monday - Friday: 9AM - 5.30PM</strong></p><p><strong>Saturday: Closed</strong></p><p><strong>Sunday: Closed</strong></p><p>If your query is not pharmacy related, our regular customer service is open <strong>Monday - Sunday: 9.00AM - 5.30PM</strong>.</p><p>If you are unable to find the information you are looking for, and it is not within our opening hours, you can email us on  <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@youthandearth.com\" title=\"mailto:enquiries@youthandearth.com\">enquiries@youthandearth.com</a>, and our pharmacist will respond next time the pharmacy is open.</p><p>If you need more immediate help visit <a href=\"http://www.nhs.uk/\">NHS's website</a>. You will also be able to find details of other local health services available there.</p><p>If you need medical help fast but it's not a 999 emergency, use the <a href=\"tel:111\">NHS 111 service</a>. Simply call 111. This service is available 24 hours a day, 365 days a year. Calls are free from landlines and mobile phones.</p><h2>Today's Responsible Pharmacist</h2><p>xxxxx — <a href=\"https://www.pharmacyregulation.org/registers/pharmacist/registrationnumber/2212970\">Pharmacist GPhC number: x</a>xxx</p><p>You can check the registration here.</p><h2>Superintendent pharmacist</h2><p>xxxxx—<a href=\"https://www.pharmacyregulation.org/registers/pharmacist/registrationnumber/2212970\">Pharmacist GPhC number: x</a>xxx</p><p>You can check the registration <a href=\"https://www.pharmacyregulation.org/registers/pharmacist\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here.</span></a></p><h2>Pharmacy owner</h2><p>EMPOWER3D LIMITED </p><p>Huckletree West Media Works, 191 Wood Lane, London, England, W12 7FP</p><p>Registered in England Company No: 09386707<br/>VAT Registration No: 316994076</p><h2>Feedback and Complaints</h2><p>At Youth & Earth, we are dedicated to providing the highest level of service and care. Your feedback is critically important to us, as it allows us to continually improve and prevent problems in the future.</p><p>If you would like to leave feedback or make a complaint regarding our pharmacy, please contact us via email  <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@youthandearth.com\" title=\"mailto:enquiries@youthandearth.com\">enquiries@youthandearth.com</a></p><p>Alternatively, you can also contact us using phone 020 3997 7800 or via post:</p><p>Nexus BioLink<br/>Unit 4<br/>Cleton Business Park<br/>Tipton<br/>United Kingdom, DY4 7TR</p><p>We will get in touch as quickly as possible, usually within one or two business days.</p><p>Any complaints will be treated confidentially.</p><h2>Getting help with making a complaint</h2><p>The easiest way to raise a complaint is to contact us directly. If you, for some reason, don't want to raise a concern directly with us at Youth & Earth, you can also contact the <a href=\"https://www.pharmacyregulation.org/raising-concerns\">GPhC</a> directly.</p><h2>Disabled Customers</h2><p>We try to do all we can to help our disabled customers. We work with accessibility standards to make this website easily accessible so that patients with e.g visual impairments can use the site using a screen reader or other assistive technology. For more information please send us an email at <a href=\"mailto:enquiries@youthandearth.com\" title=\"mailto:enquiries@youthandearth.com\">enquiries@youthandearth.com</a></p><h2>Our pharmacy services</h2><p>As your online pharmacy Youth & Earth offers a wide range of services for you, your family and your community.</p><h2>Health Advice and Self Care</h2><p>Our pharmacist is available for advice on all medicines and minor ailments, in private if required. We can also give you advice on how to live a healthy life, for example advice on how to stop smoking, or healthy diets.<br/>We also have information available on our web site and can direct you to other sources for advice and assistance if we cannot help you ourselves.</p><h2>Delivery</h2><p>We offer deliveries to your home. For more information about this read our shipping page.</p><h2>Medicines sales</h2><p>We keep a wide range of over the counter medicines and related products. Our staff members can help you to select the most appropriate products for your needs.</p><h2>Holiday healthcare</h2><p>We can advise on medical requirements for travellers, including anti-malaria medicines.</p>",
